        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PPH55, 3-1/2\" x 15\" Commercial Pull Plate with 5-1/2\" Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nInexpensive commercial door pull plate often used on restaurant doors and warehouses doors. Packaged with matching finish brass mounting screws for easy installation. It measures 15 inches high and 3-1/2 inches wide. This solid brass commercial pull plate is manufactured by Deltana, the nation\u0019s most complete provider of all of your architectural door hardware needs. Available in an array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PPH55-Specifications.gif?v=1704354531\" width=\"454\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana PPH55 3-1/2\" x 15\" Commercial Pull Plate with 5-1/2\" Handle Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/push-plate-3-5-x-15-inches-solid-brass-deltana-pp3515\"><b>Matching 3-1/2\" x 15\" Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana PPH55 Door Pull Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Height: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PPH55.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PPH55 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
