                "title": "Solid Brass 3-1/2 by 15 Pull Plate with Handle | Deltana PPH55",
                "description": "3-1/2 Inches x 15 Inches Commercial Pull Plate with 5-1/2 Inches Handle, Deltana PPH55 - Inexpensive commercial door pull plate often used on restaurant doors and warehouses doors. Packaged with matching finish brass mounting screws for easy installation. It measures 15 inches high and 3-1/2 inches wide. This solid brass commercial pull plate is manufactured by Deltana, the nation\u0019s most complete provider of all of your architectural door hardware needs. Available in 8 finishes.",
